","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"認為事情讓人很失望與生氣","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"覺得組員們講的話太過傷人","n":12,"ssz":".1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"覺得老師安排的課程沒意義","n":12,"ssz":".1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文章最後一段「下次再看到這個詞時，不妨停下來想一想：這是什麼『意思』呢？」，這句話的用意最可能是什麼？","n":53,"ssz":"......1........1..................2.................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"建議讀者閱讀時應該放慢速度","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"鼓勵讀者多背熟「意思」的定義","n":14,"ssz":".........2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"諷刺現代人對語言的使用太過隨便","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"引導讀者透過文章內容思考語詞意義","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章主要在說明什麼？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「意思」是中文裡最難理解的詞語","n":15,"ssz":"..2............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"同一個詞語在不同情況中會有不同的意義","n":18,"ssz":"..1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語言的使用應該盡量簡單清楚，避免誤會","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"多使用諧音字詞和成語能讓語言更有深度","n":18,"ssz":".......1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一句話中的「意思」與「我不是這個意思，你別誤會了」的「意思」用法最接近？","n":39,"ssz":"...1......2....1..1.2..........2......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我聽不太懂你的「意思」是什麼","n":14,"ssz":"..1......2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他說這點小「意思」，不用放在心上","n":16,"ssz":".......2..1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"真是沒「意思」的聚會，浪費我時間","n":16,"ssz":".....2.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在這麼重要的聚會遲到真是不好「意思」","n":18,"ssz":"................2."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（一☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有一次，我走路不小心撞到隔壁班的同學，連忙說：「","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"之前我們學過，代名詞也叫做指稱詞，像「你、我、他、牠、它」，可以代替前面出現的人、動物或東西，讓句子不用一直重複同一個詞。\n這一課我們要學「這、那、這些」這類的代名詞。它們常常指前面提到的一件事或一種情況。讀文章時，如果能知道「這、那、這些」指的是什麼，就更容易讀懂文章。","n":136,"ssz":".................................................11.2.1...1....1..................................2....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"之前我們學過，代名詞也叫做指稱詞，像「你、我、他、牠、它」，可以代替前面出現的人、動物或東西，讓句子不用一直重複同一個詞。","n":61,"ssz":".................................................11.2.1...1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要學「這、那、這些」這類的代名詞。它們常常指前面提到的一件事或一種情況。讀文章時，如果能知道「這、那、這些」指的是什麼，就更容易讀懂文章。","n":74,"ssz":".1..................................2....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 小試身手：\n閱讀題目，並回到課文段落閱讀，勾選出指稱詞（框框內的語詞）所代表的事物。","n":44,"ssz":"............................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 小試身手：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀題目，並回到課文段落閱讀，勾選出指稱詞（框框內的語詞）所代表的事物。","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論三步驟：\n1.往前文找找：代名詞代替的人物、狀況，多是文章前面有提到的內容、事物。當不確定代名詞在指什麼時，可以往前文找找，再根據代名詞後面的描述來推論。\n2.圈詞＋畫線：往前文找找時，你可以先把代名詞(他/她/它/牠、這/那)圈起來，畫條線連到指稱的對象。會更清楚喔。\n3.代入句子讀讀看：如果你還不太確定，可以把指稱的對象，替換到句子中讀讀看，讀起來合理了，就對了。\n例如：\n雖然老師連假前派了一堆作業，但這對美美來說是小意思。","n":218,"ssz":"............................................1..........................................................................................1.......1........1.................1..............................2..............2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論三步驟：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.往前文找找：代名詞代替的人物、狀況，多是文章前面有提到的內容、事物。當不確定代名詞在指什麼時，可以往前文找找，再根據代名詞後面的描述來推論。","n":72,"ssz":".....................................1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.圈詞＋畫線：往前文找找時，你可以先把代名詞(他/她/它/牠、這/那)圈起來，畫條線連到指稱的對象。會更清楚喔。","n":57,"ssz":".......................................................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.代入句子讀讀看：如果你還不太確定，可以把指稱的對象，替換到句子中讀讀看，讀起來合理了，就對了。","n":49,"ssz":".....1........1.................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如：","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雖然老師連假前派了一堆作業，但這對美美來說是小意思。","n":26,"ssz":".........2..............2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例句上有手繪標註：「一堆作業」被橘圈圈起、「這」被紅圈圈起，一條紅箭頭從「這」指回「一堆作業」，旁邊另有一個藍色虛線框寫著「一堆作業」。","n":68,"ssz":"..........2...............................2..........1........2....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 小試身手","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].left_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文段落---指稱詞（框框內的語詞）","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].right_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"勾選出指稱詞所代表的事物","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第一段)我心想這人的確蠻不錯，聽說還常常幫忙同學，講話又幽默，或許是個很有意思的人。","n":43,"ssz":"..........1..1.....................1...2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這人","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"旁邊的朋友","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隔壁班同學","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第一段)但我最愛的笑話類型是諧音冷笑話，不知道他會不會覺得跟這種人相處起來很沒意思呢？","n":44,"ssz":"..........................1..1....1......2.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這種人","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].answer_template","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這種人=（　）諧音冷笑話的人","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"喜歡","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不喜歡","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第三段)在我們的日常對話中，「意思」可不只是「意義」這麼簡單，它還能變化出許多不同的意義。","n":46,"ssz":".................2............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"它","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「意思」這個詞","n":7,"ssz":"..2..1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「意義」這個詞","n":7,"ssz":".....1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第四段)今天家政課，我們做杯子蛋糕，從準備材料、打蛋、進烤箱，到最後吃到成品，這過程真的很有意思！","n":50,"ssz":"...............1................................2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這過程","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"吃杯子蛋糕的過程","n":8,"ssz":"..1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"做杯子蛋糕的過程","n":8,"ssz":"..1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第四段)但有小組卻因為誤會彼此的意思而吵架，事後還說：「這根本一點意思都沒有！」","n":41,"ssz":"...........1......2.............2..2....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一起做杯子蛋糕","n":7,"ssz":"....1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誤會彼此的意思","n":7,"ssz":"......2"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(第六段)也正因為這些不同，讓語言變得這麼好玩、有趣。","n":27,"ssz":"........1.........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這些不同","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圖案的不同","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"意思的不同","n":5,"ssz":".2..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎推論小偵探","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"底下文字中的「這」是指不同的事情，請試試看推論「這」是指什麼？","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小恩今天到教室後，發現抽屜裡多了一張紙條。這會是誰放的呢？他心裡有點驚訝。紙條上寫著：「加油！你一定可以的！」看到這，小恩忍不住笑了。他立刻想到，是不是昨天他和朋友說完自己很擔心數學考試後，朋友偷偷放的？","n":102,"ssz":"................2...............................1.............1...........1....1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"A：第一個「這」是指（　）；第二個「這」是指（　）","n":25,"ssz":"................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紙條","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紙條上的字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:keypoints.intro","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本篇文章運用小故事方式舉出了「意思」不同的用法，現在就請你讀一讀例句，選出「意思」在句子中的解釋，並填入代號。","n":55,"ssz":"................2......................2...1..........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例句","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"配對","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表達歉意或害羞","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表示對某人有好感","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指人很有趣、有魅力","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表示人無趣、不好相處","n":10,"ssz":"........1."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.E","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"活動、事情的有趣或無趣","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.F","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想法","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.G","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指這件事很簡單、沒什麼難度","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.option_bank.H","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用一點小東西，表示心意或感謝","n":14,"ssz":".2............"},{"section":"served:keypoints.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（教師版答案），文字流有此資訊","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.這訓練量對先發選手來說只是「小意思」。","n":21,"ssz":"..................2.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.他「意思意思」捐了點錢，表達對活動的支持。","n":23,"ssz":".....2.2..............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.相處久了，其實就會知道這個人「沒什麼意思」。","n":24,"ssz":"..1...........1......2.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[3].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.一直到現在我都還搞不清楚他當初是什麼「意思」。","n":25,"ssz":"..2...................2.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[4].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"5.他一直找話題跟我聊天，是不是對我「有意思」？","n":24,"ssz":"...2..........1......2.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[5].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"6.他對很多事情都能分享想法，真是「有意思」的人。","n":25,"ssz":"....................2...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[6].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"7.臨時才拜託他幫忙，還真的是有點「不好意思」。","n":24,"ssz":".....................2.."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[7].例句","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"8.這個展覽結合了許多AI互動，真的「很有意思」。","n":25,"ssz":"...1..................2.."},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□①表達歉意或害羞 □②表示對某人有好感 □③指人很有趣、有魅力 □④表示人無趣、不好相處 □⑤活動、事情的有趣或無趣 □⑥想法 ⑦指這件事很簡單、沒什麼難度 □⑧用一點小東西，表示心意或感謝","n":96,"ssz":"...........................................1.......................................2............"},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□①表達歉意或害羞 □②表示對某人有好感 □③指人很有趣、有魅力 □④表示人無趣、不好相處 □⑤活動、事情的有趣或無趣 □⑥想法 □⑦指這件事很簡單、沒什麼難度 ⑧用一點小東西，表示心意或感謝","n":96,"ssz":"...........................................1.......................................2............"},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□①表達歉意或害羞 □②表示對某人有好感 □③指人很有趣、有魅力 ④表示人無趣、不好相處 □⑤活動、事情的有趣或無趣 □⑥想法 □⑦指這件事很簡單、沒什麼難度 □⑧用一點小東西，表示心意或感謝","n":96,"ssz":"..........................................1........................................2............"},{"section":"served:story_structure_table[4][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"□①表達歉意或害羞 □②表示對某人有好感 □③指人很有趣、有魅力 □④表示人無趣、不好相處 □⑤活動、事情的有趣或無趣 ⑥想法 □⑦指這件事很簡單、沒什麼難度 □⑧用一點小東西，表示心意或感謝","n":96,"ssz":"....................